msgid ".40 S&W JHP"
msgstr ".40 S&W 空尖彈"

#. ~ Description for .40 S&W JHP
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".40 S&W ammunition with 135gr JHP bullets.  The .40 S&W round is a descended"
" from the 10mm Auto cartridge and maintains most of its predecessor's "
"strengths while reducing recoil."
msgstr ""
".40 S&W 空尖彈使用 135 格令空尖彈頭。改良自 10mm Auto 彈, .40 S&W 子彈繼承了前者大多數的優點, 同時降低了其後座力。"

