"A covered leather pouch, worn at the waist to store and protect prepared "
"blackpowder cartridges."
msgstr "一個皮革袋子, 穿戴於腰間以儲存並保護製作完畢的黑火藥彈夾。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wrist bandolier"
msgid_plural "wrist bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "手腕子彈帶"

