msgid ""
"A pair of customized, kevlar armored cloth boots, modified to provide "
"maximum protection from harm, even when knee-deep in the dead."
msgstr "一雙訂製的靴子, 由凱夫勒裝甲與棉布製成。即使身陷重圍也能提供極致的防護能力以抵禦傷害。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
