msgstr "有著鋼頭的皮革靴子。超耐用。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of survivor boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of survivor boots"
msgstr[0] "生存者靴"

#. ~ Description for pair of survivor boots
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of customized leather boots, armored with kevlar and modified to "
"provide maximum protection from harm, even when knee-deep in the dead."
msgstr "一雙訂製的靴子, 由凱夫勒裝甲與皮革製成。即使身陷重圍也能提供極致的防護能力以抵禦傷害。"

