msgid_plural "\"deluxe\" sandwiches"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for deluxe sandwich
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sandwich of meat, vegetables, and cheese with condiments.  Tasty and "
"nutritious!"
msgstr "一份夾著肉、蔬菜、起司配上調味料的三明治。美味又營養!"

#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
