"For those gun nuts.  Don't have enough near-future firearms in your life?  "
"Add this mod today!"
msgstr "適合槍狂的模組。你的生活需要更多的近未來槍械? 立即加上這個模組!"

#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
