"Only spawn classic zombies and natural wildlife.  This disables certain "
"buildings and map extras."
msgstr "只產生傳統的殭屍和野生動物。這會禁用某些建築物與地圖特殊區域。"

#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
