"Adds indicator icon if a creature sees the player.  Designed for the "
"retrodays tileset."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
msgid "SpeedyDex"
msgstr "敏捷影響速度"

#. ~ Description for SpeedyDex
#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
msgid "Higher dex increases your speed."
msgstr "較高的敏捷會提高你的速度。"

#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
msgid "Stats Through Kills"
msgstr "擊殺獲得屬性"

#. ~ Description for Stats Through Kills
#: lang/json/MOD_INFO_from_json.py
msgid "You gain XP from kills that you can spend on increasing your stats."
msgstr "在擊殺時獲得經驗值，可以用來提升你的屬性。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chicken"
msgid_plural "chickens"
msgstr[0] "雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chicken'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A domesticated descendant of junglefowl, it may still be the most numerous "
"bird in the world.  Before the Cataclysm, it was raised by humans as a "
"source of meat, eggs, and early morning wakeup calls."
msgstr "一個被馴化的原雞, 可能仍然是世界上數量最多的鳥類了。在災變前, 是人類飼養的肉類、蛋、與每天早上的鬧鐘。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grouse"
msgid_plural "grouses"
msgstr[0] "松雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grouse'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very common game bird, these creatures remind you of what a wild chicken "
"must have been like."
msgstr "這是一種常見的野生鳥類, 這些生物會讓你想起野雞該有的模樣。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crow"
msgid_plural "crows"
msgstr[0] "烏鴉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crow'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, elegant black bird, famous for its distinctive call.  An "
"intelligent bird, there is a glitter of mischief behind its eyes."
msgstr "優雅的小黑鳥, 叫聲奇特、聰明伶俐, 眼神透露出想惡作劇的淘氣感。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "duck"
msgid_plural "ducks"
msgstr[0] "鴨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'duck'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mallard duck, often seen around rivers and other bodies of water.  It "
"feeds primarily on insects, seeds, roots, and, pre-Cataclysm, bread scraps."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "goose"
msgid_plural "geese"
msgstr[0] "鵝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'goose', 'str_pl': 'geese'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A Canadian goose, a common waterfowl that regrets leaving Canada."
msgstr "加拿大鵝, 一種常見的水禽, 後悔離開加拿大。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "turkey"
msgid_plural "turkeys"
msgstr[0] "火雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'turkey'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and colorful game bird native to the forests of North America.  Its "
"head and beak are covered in fleshy protuberances."
msgstr "一種大而多彩的鳥, 原產於北美洲的森林。它的頭部和嘴披覆著肉質。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pheasant"
msgid_plural "pheasants"
msgstr[0] "雉雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pheasant'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A medium sized game bird that can have bright feathers depending on the sex "
"and species."
msgstr "中等大小的野生鳥類, 根據性別和種類不同, 會有亮麗的羽毛。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cockatrice"
msgid_plural "cockatrices"
msgstr[0] "雞蛇"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cockatrice'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This strange mutant bird gains its name from its odd appearance.  Although "
"its features seem to be becoming more reptilian, it doesn't appear "
"dangerous."
msgstr "這隻奇怪的突變鳥從不尋常的外表中得其名。雖然牠的特徵似乎變得越來越像爬蟲類，它看起來並不危險。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "yellow chick"
msgid_plural "yellow chicks"
msgstr[0] "黃色小雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yellow chick'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tiny yellow and brown chick, it could be from a number of different "
"species."
msgstr "一隻黃色和棕色相兼的小雞，它可能來自許多不同的物種。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "brown chick"
msgid_plural "brown chicks"
msgstr[0] "棕色小雞"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "strange chick"
msgid_plural "strange chicks"
msgstr[0] "奇異小雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'strange chick'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A strange tiny chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "一隻奇異的雞，它可能來自許多不同的物種。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "waterfowl chick"
msgid_plural "waterfowl chicks"
msgstr[0] "水禽小雞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'waterfowl chick'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tiny yellow and brown waterfowl chick, it could be from a number of "
"different species."
msgstr "一種黃色和棕色相兼的水禽小雞，它可能來自許多不同的物種。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "M16A4 autonomous TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "M16A4 autonomous TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "M16A4 自主性 TALON 無人地面載具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M16A4 autonomous TALON UGV'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A TALON unmanned ground vehicle equipped with an M16A4.  It is a small "
"tracked UGV with an array of motors and sensors covering its weapon mount."
msgstr "一台配備 M16A4 步槍的 TALON 無人地面載具。這台小型履帶式的地面無人機，在武器架上裝有一組電動機與傳感器陣列。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "M202A1 autonomous TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "M202A1 autonomous TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "M202A1 自主性 TALON 無人地面載具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M202A1 autonomous TALON UGV'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A TALON unmanned ground vehicle equipped with an M202A1 FLASH.  It is a "
"small tracked UGV with an array of motors and sensors covering its weapon "
"mount."
msgstr "一台配備 M202A1 肩射式火焰進攻武器的 TALON 無人地面載具。這台小型履帶式的地面無人機，在武器架上裝有一組電動機與傳感器陣列。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skitterbot"
msgid_plural "skitterbots"
msgstr[0] "爬蟲機器人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skitterbot'}
#. ~ Description for skitterbot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An insectoid robot the size of a small dog, designed for home security.  "
"Armed with two close-range tazers, it can skate across the ground with great"
" speed."
msgstr "一個昆蟲外型的機器人，大小跟小狗一樣，設計作為居家保全使用。搭載兩個近距離電擊槍，並能夠以極快的速度在地面滑行。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "experimental lab bot"
msgid_plural "experimental lab bots"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'experimental lab bot'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This robot looks like a large metal spider, a bit bigger than a person, with"
" its thorax covered in tiny holes.  An ominous buzzing emanates from it."
msgstr "這個機器人看下去看一隻大型金屬蜘蛛，稍為比普通人大，在胸膛的位置佈滿非常細小的孔。不詳的嗡嗡聲從它身上發出來。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "prototype robot"
msgid_plural "prototype robots"
msgstr[0] "原型機器人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'prototype robot'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The single glowing eye of this robot surveys the landscape periodically, as "
"it performs the endless slaughter dictated by a misinterpreted and cruel "
"routine.  Between half-built plates, you can see the machinery and cables "
"that animate it, and yet it moves deftly as it switches between one target "
"and the next."
msgstr ""
"這個機器人的單一發光眼睛週期性地掃描周遭，由於曲解命令跟殘酷的日常工作，它執行著無止盡的殺戮。你能看到未完成的護甲板裡面的機械裝置與電纜線，這讓它有行動能力，並在目標間靈巧地移動著。"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "NR-031 Dispatch"
msgid_plural "NR-031 Dispatches"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'NR-031 Dispatch', 'str_pl': 'NR-031 Dispatches'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northrop Dispatch, designed for crowd control situations, carries and "
"deploys kamikaze drones of various types.  The bright green-and-yellow paint"
" marks a low-force variant - *comparatively* low-force, anyways - typically "
"deployed as guards after an area has been cleared."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "NR-V05-M Dispatch"
msgid_plural "NR-V05-M Dispatches"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'NR-V05-M Dispatch', 'str_pl': 'NR-V05-M
#. Dispatches'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northrop Dispatch, designed for crowd control situations, carries and "
"deploys kamikaze drones of various types.  The dark green paint job marks "
"the lethal and feared military variant, carrying extreme and deadly "
"firepower."
msgstr ""

