msgstr "該倖存者在烹調術領域擁有豐富的經驗，是一名專業廚師或同等水平的廚師。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Electrical Engineering Training"
msgstr "電機工程培訓"

#. ~ Description for Electrical Engineering Training
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This survivor has some formal training in electrical engineering, but not "
"much experience."
msgstr "該倖存者接受過一些電機工程領域的正規培訓，但經驗不足。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Electrical Engineering Expert"
