msgid "Mechanical Engineering Expert"
msgstr "機械工程專家"

#. ~ Description for Mechanical Engineering Expert
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This survivor has extensive experience in mechanical engineering: an EngD, "
"extensive field experience, or equivalent."
msgstr "該倖存者在機械工程方面擁有豐富的經驗：機械工程博士，廣博的現場經驗或同等學歷。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Software Engineering Training"
msgstr "軟體工程培訓"

#. ~ Description for Software Engineering Training
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This survivor has some formal training in software engineering, but not much"
" experience."
msgstr "該倖存者接受過一些軟體工程領域的正規培訓，但經驗不足。"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Software Engineering Expert"
msgstr "軟體工程專家"

#. ~ Description for Software Engineering Expert
