msgstr "妳只在聚光燈後工作，確保著所有表演者能獲得所需，並讓一切運作順暢。這些日子風險越來越高了，但是表演還是要繼續下去。"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "音樂家"

#. ~ Profession (male Musician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
