msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Skiier"
msgstr "滑雪運動員"

#. ~ Profession (male Skiier) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The slopes of New England are nice this time of year, and you were spending "
"the month on vacation at a resort when you were evacuated."
msgstr "每年的這個時候，新英格蘭的山坡都很漂亮，當你被疏散時，你正在渡假勝地度過一個月的假期。"

