#. ~ Profession (male Librarian) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The librarian's calling is a simple one, but it suited you fine.  When the "
"sirens sounded, you grabbed some manuals on your way out, and the book you "
"never got to publish."
msgstr "以圖書管理員當作職志是很單純的，也是很適合你的。當警鈴響起，你抓了幾本手冊與從未出版的手稿。"

