msgstr "那裡已經有家具（%s）了。"

#: src/iuse_actor.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You set up the %s on the ground."
msgstr "你在地面上設立了 %s。"

#: src/iuse_actor.cpp
msgid "Examine the center square to pack it up again."
msgstr "檢查中央格子來再次打包。"

